&lt;p&gt;Also, I have measured cost of &lt;tt&gt;ConcurrentSkipListSet&lt;/tt&gt; invocations. It&apos;s cheap enough, lower than 1 us even in high contended mode (adding, getting first, 32 threads).&lt;/p&gt;

